	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam et vitae innocentiam a domino.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Ego vero, venerande <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>frater, non facile loco cederem<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> hatte angekündigt, sein Amt aufzugeben, falls er zur Annahme der neuen Universitätsstatuten gezwungen werde; s. oben <ref target="file11307">Nr. 1264</ref>, 5-7.</note>.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Pastor es.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Oves tibi comm[issae] <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>sunt.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Nunc agitur de pabulo ovium, et penes quos sit aut[ho]ri<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>tas dispensandi pabuli.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Universitas omnem author[ita]tem <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>sibi cupit vendicare subditis sibi pastoribus.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Qu[um] <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>mox atque libere et ingenue administrarint pabu[lum], <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>illa vocet et vexet, aliter scilicet concionandum esse etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="de"><foreign xml:lang="la">L[icet] <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>enim nunc non ita proponatur</foreign>, so wirts doch mitt d[er] <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>zyt also gon.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Quis novit, quales futuri sint aliqu[ando] <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>universitatis praesides?</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Ecclesiae est illa potestas.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Uni[ver]s<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>itas non est ecclesia, sed membrum, nisi impia sit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Sc[ilicet] <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>subesse debet doctoribus.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Doctores ecclesiarum pastor[es] <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>sunt, qui tamen ministros se, non dominos agnoscunt ecc[lesiae].</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Was gond si hür und fernn<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" ana="lex" n="2">immerdar.</note> mit dem hochfertigen bu[tzen]<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>werck<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">hoffärtigen Mummenschanz (vgl. auch <persName ref="p4091">Zwinglis</persName> "Der Hirt", <bibl source="b700">Z</bibl> III 36, 1).</note> umb?</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Fortiter te illis oppone.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Minare <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>te negotium toti ecclesiae propositurum.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Nam crede m[ihi] <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>id <placeName ref="l28">Basileiensi</placeName> ecclesiae aliquando usu venturum, quod hod[ie] <lb xml:id="p1z18"/><placeName ref="l157">Francfordiae</placeName> nostris usu venisse doleo.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Consensere e[nim], <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ut 6 viri iique animis tranquillis, id est flexibilibus <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>p[...] totam causam religionis contraversam componant<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Zum Religionsgespräch, auf das man sich im <placeName ref="l157">Frankfurter</placeName> Anstand vom 19. April geeinigt hatte, s. oben <ref target="file11304">Nr. 1261</ref>, Anm. 6.</note>.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Iunget i[llis] <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>augustus et caesar<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName></note> arbitros.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">An non poterunt aliqu<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>an[do de] <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>universitate 4 viri censu<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>ram sibi <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>dogmatum et [mo]rum sumere et pro libitu contra liberam verit<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>at[em] pronunciare?</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de">Denn<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" ana="lex" n="6">Dann.</note> so muͦß mans also haben, man [hatts] <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>gewöllen.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">An non consultius respondissent <placeName ref="l157">Francf[or]diae</placeName>: „<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Veritati innitimur canonicae; huic immor[iemur]; <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>si vobis errare<pb type="edition" next="135"/> videmur, scripturis convincite a[ut] <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>cessate.“?</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Quorsum opus erat colloquium admittere [cum] <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>illis, de quibus, quid speremus, non ignoramus?</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Si co[lloquium] <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Evae cum serpente<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><cit type="bible"><ref>Gen 3, 1-5</ref></cit> (vgl. auch oben <ref target="file11305">Nr. 1262</ref>, 340.</note> bene cessit, nobis quoque colloquia [cum] <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>papistis de compositione Christi et Belial<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>2Kor 6, 15</ref></cit>.</note>, id est [evan]<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>gelii et papismi bene cedent.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Sed huc spectavi<lb xml:id="p1z36"/>t [quo]rundam concordandi tam anxium studium.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Isti al[iquam] <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>compositionem etiam cum monachis et pfaffis ind[ucunt].</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/>Sed hoc tibi ut fido in cor tuum et sinum tuum [effun]do.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z39"/>Tu, mi <persName ref="p8418">Myconi</persName>, fortis sis, simplici [verita]<lb xml:id="p1z40"/>ti studeas et valeas semper mei memor<lb xml:id="p1z41"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="de">D[er wi]derwertigen<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" ana="lex" n="9">Feinde.</note> enet <placeName ref="l2459">Ryns</placeName><note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">jenseits des <placeName ref="l2459">Rheins</placeName>.</note> und pfäffischen sind [vil].</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z42"/>Wachet in fröuden.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="de">Die unsern, hoch beckü[mmert],<pb type="scan" next="19v."/> <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>besorgend, uß dem componieren werdint nahin<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" ana="lex" n="11">nachher.</note> vil ge<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>tränt, die vor eins warind.</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="de">Schlächts<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" ana="lex" n="12">Kurzum.</note>, man wird <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ghein composition annemmen.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="de">Die warheyt ist zu<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ͦ heyter<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" ana="lex" n="13">klar.</note>.</s>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="de">Dorumb wirts ein groß verfolgen gäben.</s>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Gott verlych der einfalten wahrheyt syg.</s>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="de">Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="37" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/>Plura nunc non potui.</s>
					<s n="38" xml:lang="la">Nam vixdum absolvimus negotia <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>synodi<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Die Synode trat am 6. Mai zusammen; vgl. oben <ref target="file11308">Nr. 1265</ref>, Anm. 31.</note>.</s>
					<s n="39" xml:lang="la">Ama me.</s>
					<s n="40" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vive et vale et cito scribe.</s>
					<s n="41" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z8"/>Mir gfallt die <placeName ref="l157">Franckfurtisch</placeName> handlung imm hertzen nüt, <lb xml:id="p2z9"/><foreign xml:lang="la">ut libere tibi dicam animi mei secretum</foreign>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="42" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><persName ref="p8171">Theodorus</persName><note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15"><persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName>.</note>, <lb xml:id="p2z10"/><persName ref="p8127">Pellicanus</persName> et reliqui te salvere iubent.</s>
					<s n="43" xml:lang="la">7. maii 1539.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="44" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p495">H. Bullingerus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse darunter:]</note>
					<s n="45" xml:lang="la">Domino <persName ref="p8418">Os<lb xml:id="p2z11"/>valdo Myconio</persName>, antisti<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>ti <placeName ref="l28">Basileiensi</placeName>, fratri colendissimo<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>Daneben Notenlinien und Musiknoten (Schluß einer Baßstimme) von unbekannter Hand.</hi></note>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
